   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y02",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "等等，一顿酒而已，他跑什么？",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y03",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "他叫刘邦。两千多年前，他抢先打下了秦朝的都城。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y04",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "手握四十万大军的项羽气炸了：“明天就打他！”",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y05",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "刘邦只有十万人，第二天一早，赶紧上门赔罪。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y06",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "项羽留他喝酒。这顿酒，就叫鸿门宴。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y07",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "可项羽的谋士范增，一心想杀了刘邦。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y08",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "他三次举起玉佩给项羽看，项羽不理。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y09",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "范增就叫来一个手下：“你去舞剑，趁机杀了刘邦。”",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y10",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "手下拔剑起舞，剑总往刘邦那边去。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y11",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "项羽的叔叔也拔剑跳了起来，用身子护住刘邦。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y12",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "头天晚上，刘邦刚和这位叔叔约好做亲家。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y13",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "刘邦的部下樊哙撞倒卫兵冲进来，瞪着项羽。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y14",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "项羽说：“壮士！赏他一条猪腿。”端上来的是生的。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y15",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "樊哙把盾牌扣在地上当案板，拔剑切着就吃。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y16",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "过了一会儿，刘邦起身去上厕所，把樊哙也叫了出去。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y17",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "出了门，樊哙说：“人家是刀和案板，咱们是鱼和肉，还告什么辞！”",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y18",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "刘邦丢下车马，抄小路逃回了军营。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y19",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "等他跑远了，留下的部下才进去送礼，说他喝多了。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y20",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "范增拔剑把送他的玉杯砸得粉碎：“夺项羽天下的，一定是刘邦！”",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y21",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "四年后，刘邦果然打败项羽，当上了皇帝。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
    "stability": 0.2,
    "similarity_boost": 0.8,
    "style": 0.75,
    "speed": 1.2,
    "use_speaker_boost": true
   },
   "add": {
    "owner": "5ec7715ee5949825dc0959dee2f1f30693d4a5d1ae49c50c078270f5d886caf7",
    "voice_id": "9DMBSOAnMDPiFAsz1ZGK",
    "name": "Xiaoxi - Neutral, Young and Friendly"
   },
   "keep": true
  },
  {
   "name": "y22",
   "lang": "zh",
   "text": "而鸿门宴上，他只是去上了个厕所。",
   "model": "eleven_v4",
   "settings": {
